{"title":"2003 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is <i>not</i> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/799c1df6245bee8a9a1dfcde8679e3e6072fb2e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557e6aa9e626857f0965fcb13dff7db21b237739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{6^2}{10} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{1}{5}[6(3)]) \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{18 + 1}{15 + 1} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 3.6 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\sqrt{\\frac{324}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"553\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply try answer choices until we get one that isn't equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/799c1df6245bee8a9a1dfcde8679e3e6072fb2e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026a700046ebc9a88719773fbee2b688a0b7299b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6^2}{10} = \\frac{36}{10} = \\frac{36 \\div 2}{10 \\div 2} = \\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"195\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/5/1159be2ba1da76413174d7871fd369f5fc1e2108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}[6(3)]) = \\frac{1}{5} \\times 18 = \\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"189\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19d41f86a41b23ce2d518841548981d7957eae8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18 + 1}{15 + 1} = \\frac{19}{16} \\neq \\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>This shows us that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313496a02cae3c41507c498b7bc3c1f5f66141e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } \\frac{18 + 1}{15 + 1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"102\" height=\"51\" />.\n</p><p>We can also verify that the others are equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/799c1df6245bee8a9a1dfcde8679e3e6072fb2e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/b/74b631517b5f422bddcc4de184f610c8278d63de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.6 = \\frac{36}{10} = \\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a3d006ce7872de0ce30bf9e565d8326dc50a17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"86\" height=\"46\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/1570255e4b00bb294e37b70a3bd15e27d672f905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{324}{25}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{324}}{\\sqrt{25}} = \\frac{18}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"168\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2477/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32600:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202429 and revision id 251685. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}